# Allowlist, not a denylist: exclude everything, then re-include only the files the
# build actually needs. A new secret or artifact dropped in the repo root therefore
# cannot reach the build context by default — it has to be added here on purpose.
#
# Without this, `COPY ./ /src` sweeps in the live config.yml (real Slack webhook),
# uptime.db + WAL, and .git.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!config.yml.example
